  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson. Double click on mathematical expressions/equations to enlarge.</para>

<para>For questions 1 - 2, find the quotients using division.</para>
<!--Do not edit this div tag.  It must surround the interaction block-->
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="af56f7e8-d1e7-434e-b3eb-e09a0a5bd450"><problem><para>
      <para>\(\frac{45x^5y^9}{-60x^8y^6}\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(-\frac{3x^3}{4y^3}\)</para><para>\(-\frac{4y^3}{3x^3}\)</para><para>\(-\frac{3y^3}{4x^3}\)</para><para>\(-\frac{3}{4}x^3y^3\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(-\frac{3y^3}{4x^3}\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(-\frac{3y^3}{4x^3}\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
